  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "In \\(\\triangle ABC,\\) \\(AB=5,\\) \\(BC=7,\\) \\(AC=9\\) and \\(D\\) is on \\(\\overline{AC}\\) with \\(BD=5.\\) Find the ratio \\(AD:DC.\\)",
